  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>Wink Supplies AU is an Australian lash supply brand built for artists who love quality products, luxe aesthetics, and a clean, elevated brand feel. We offer lash essentials designed to support artists in creating beautiful results while using products they feel confident to recommend.</p><p>Our affiliate program is perfect for lash artists and beauty creators who want to share products they genuinely use and love. Affiliates earn 8% commission on every order made through their affiliate link or coupon code, and their code gives customers 10% off their orders. Commissions are paid via PayPal once the account reaches the $65 payout threshold.</p><p>What makes Wink Supplies AU different is the combination of performance, branding, and community. We want our affiliates to feel proud to represent a brand that is professional, aesthetic, and aligned with the beauty industry.</p><p>Affiliates can promote us through Instagram and TikTok content including stories, reels, posts, tutorials, unboxings, and authentic product recommendations. Applications are manually approved, open internationally, and best suited to creators who align with our brand values and audience.</p></div></div>",
